        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358">

                <pb facs="0368" n="252" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg252"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/660.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-02">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 2, 1912</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>From apparently reliable information it is evident that negroes have bought large
                    quantities of knives and other arms and that many negroes have left the
                    city.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
